   "seed": 646284942,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 872039787,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Diagrams in this file\n1  System architecture: what talks to what\n2  Run flow: what happens every hour, step by step\n3  Sequence: the exact API calls, in order\n4  Diff engine: how two versions are compared\n5a/b/c  Message layouts: Google Chat · Slack · Telegram\n6  Schedule: when it runs\n7  Errors & retries: what happens when something fails\n8  Repo & data files: what is stored where\n9  Setup in 5 steps\n10  Channels: how each one works + how to add more",
   "originalText": "Diagrams in this file\n1  System architecture: what talks to what\n2  Run flow: what happens every hour, step by step\n3  Sequence: the exact API calls, in order\n4  Diff engine: how two versions are compared\n5a/b/c  Message layouts: Google Chat · Slack · Telegram\n6  Schedule: when it runs\n7  Errors & retries: what happens when something fails\n8  Repo & data files: what is stored where\n9  Setup in 5 steps\n10  Channels: how each one works + how to add more",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "CaJ4KUXYYTnyCeTwQvT7",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "L6autoC3NPSvEDDUoHF3",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 900,
   "y": 410,
   "width": 960,
   "height": 300,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
