   "text": "Token names below Enterprise\n\nThe API gives variable IDs only\n(the names API is Enterprise-only).\nA tiny private plugin you run in Figma\nsaves ID → name to variables-map.json.\nRe-run it when tokens change.\nUnknown ID → style name → hex.",
   "originalText": "Token names below Enterprise\n\nThe API gives variable IDs only\n(the names API is Enterprise-only).\nA tiny private plugin you run in Figma\nsaves ID → name to variables-map.json.\nRe-run it when tokens change.\nUnknown ID → style name → hex.",
