   "text": "Mobile\n• Same change in 2 frames: Home, Profile\n    – Added: Badge\n    – Title: text changed\n          Before: «مرحبا»\n          After: «أهلاً وسهلاً»\n• Settings\n    – CTA: colour #1A73E8 → brand/600\n    – Card: bottom padding 12 → 16\n• Approvals (New)",
   "originalText": "Mobile\n• Same change in 2 frames: Home, Profile\n    – Added: Badge\n    – Title: text changed\n          Before: «مرحبا»\n          After: «أهلاً وسهلاً»\n• Settings\n    – CTA: colour #1A73E8 → brand/600\n    – Card: bottom padding 12 → 16\n• Approvals (New)",
