   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Turning channels on / off\n\n• Add a channel’s secrets → on.\n• Remove them, or set\n  \"enabled\": false in config.json\n  → off. No code change.\n• New channel joins at the\n  current version (no flood of\n  old history).",
   "originalText": "Turning channels on / off\n\n• Add a channel’s secrets → on.\n• Remove them, or set\n  \"enabled\": false in config.json\n  → off. No code change.\n• New channel joins at the\n  current version (no flood of\n  old history).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "j8Xvf4QTQBzpAwKcT9DY",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
