   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Typical timing\n\n• Edit, then walk away  →  ~30 min autosave + 0–60 min\n   ≈ 30–90 minutes, usually about an hour\n• Edit, then ⌘⌥S (save to version history)\n   →  at the next :07, within the hour\n• ⌘⌥S, then Actions › Run workflow  →  ~1 minute\n• Several versions waiting  →  one message each, oldest first",
   "originalText": "Typical timing\n\n• Edit, then walk away  →  ~30 min autosave + 0–60 min\n   ≈ 30–90 minutes, usually about an hour\n• Edit, then ⌘⌥S (save to version history)\n   →  at the next :07, within the hour\n• ⌘⌥S, then Actions › Run workflow  →  ~1 minute\n• Several versions waiting  →  one message each, oldest first",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "hzMknZCr2ZXxHWGRVyVd",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
