   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Good to know\n• Minute 7, not 0: GitHub is busiest on the hour and may delay those runs.\n• Work hours only instead: '7 6-16 * * 0-4' (cron is UTC).\n• Cost: ~720 runs/month × 1 min. Private repo: inside the 2,000 free\n   minutes. Public repo: Actions minutes are free.\n• No new version = no message. Pause: Actions › ⋯ › Disable workflow.\n• Public repos: GitHub disables schedules after 60 days without commits.",
   "originalText": "Good to know\n• Minute 7, not 0: GitHub is busiest on the hour and may delay those runs.\n• Work hours only instead: '7 6-16 * * 0-4' (cron is UTC).\n• Cost: ~720 runs/month × 1 min. Private repo: inside the 2,000 free\n   minutes. Public repo: Actions minutes are free.\n• No new version = no message. Pause: Actions › ⋯ › Disable workflow.\n• Public repos: GitHub disables schedules after 60 days without commits.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "24x5jsYoYAVuak5Gage2",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
