   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "figma-changelog/\n├─ .github/workflows/\n│   └─ changelog.yml        hourly + manual run\n├─ src/\n│   ├─ index.js             main loop + commands\n│   ├─ config.js            config.json, .env, secrets\n│   ├─ http.js              retries (429, 5xx)\n│   ├─ figma.js             Figma REST client\n│   ├─ diff.js              compare two versions\n│   ├─ describe.js          changes → plain words\n│   ├─ update.js            one Update for all channels\n│   ├─ images.js            pick frames, save PNGs\n│   ├─ changelog.js         CHANGELOG.md writer\n│   ├─ state.js             state.json\n│   └─ channels/            one file per channel\n│       ├─ gchat.js         cardsV2 + threadKey\n│       ├─ slack.js         Block Kit + thread_ts\n│       └─ telegram.js      HTML + albums + reply-to\n├─ test/                    node --test, fake servers\n├─ figma-plugin/            exports token names\n├─ docs/diagrams/           these diagrams\n├─ config.json              your settings\n├─ variables-map.json       variable ID → token name\n├─ state.json               made by the first run\n├─ CHANGELOG.md             made by runs\n├─ changelog-images/        made by runs\n├─ .env.example             copy to .env (git-ignored)\n├─ package.json             no dependencies\n└─ README.md",
   "originalText": "figma-changelog/\n├─ .github/workflows/\n│   └─ changelog.yml        hourly + manual run\n├─ src/\n│   ├─ index.js             main loop + commands\n│   ├─ config.js            config.json, .env, secrets\n│   ├─ http.js              retries (429, 5xx)\n│   ├─ figma.js             Figma REST client\n│   ├─ diff.js              compare two versions\n│   ├─ describe.js          changes → plain words\n│   ├─ update.js            one Update for all channels\n│   ├─ images.js            pick frames, save PNGs\n│   ├─ changelog.js         CHANGELOG.md writer\n│   ├─ state.js             state.json\n│   └─ channels/            one file per channel\n│       ├─ gchat.js         cardsV2 + threadKey\n│       ├─ slack.js         Block Kit + thread_ts\n│       └─ telegram.js      HTML + albums + reply-to\n├─ test/                    node --test, fake servers\n├─ figma-plugin/            exports token names\n├─ docs/diagrams/           these diagrams\n├─ config.json              your settings\n├─ variables-map.json       variable ID → token name\n├─ state.json               made by the first run\n├─ CHANGELOG.md             made by runs\n├─ changelog-images/        made by runs\n├─ .env.example             copy to .env (git-ignored)\n├─ package.json             no dependencies\n└─ README.md",
