   "text": "CHANGELOG.md  (one entry per version, newest on top)\n\n## 2026-11-10 10:42 · Alex · 7 changes\n_Checkout flow v2_\n### Mobile\n- Same change in 2 frames: **Home**, **Profile**\n  - Title: text changed\n    - Before: «مرحبا»\n    - After: «أهلاً وسهلاً»\n| Before | After |\n|---|---|\n| ![](changelog-images/2026-11-10-6789012345/12-34-before.png) | ![](…/12-34-after.png) |",
