   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Where secrets live: GitHub › Settings › Secrets (for the automatic runs) and a local .env\nfile (for your dry runs). Never in code, never in chat, never in the log.\nRepo size: ~150–300 KB per PNG at 2× → a busy update ≈ 2–3 MB. Years of room; can prune later.",
   "originalText": "Where secrets live: GitHub › Settings › Secrets (for the automatic runs) and a local .env\nfile (for your dry runs). Never in code, never in chat, never in the log.\nRepo size: ~150–300 KB per PNG at 2× → a busy update ≈ 2–3 MB. Years of room; can prune later.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "wi4SqzBLGKKGKK5pzfNW",
