   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "⚠ Seat check: the token must belong to a Full or Dev seat on a paid Figma plan.\nView / Collab seats get very low API limits → constant 429 errors. The dry run\nlogs “Figma API calls: N · no throttling” so you know before automating.",
